    },
    {
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Daily Market Close (16:30 WIB)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 16 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "configuration",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        500,
        340
      ],
      "notes": "Pusat kontrol parameter siskamling: atur threshold skor, jumlah top gainers, dan hari data tanpa koding.",
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "alert_threshold",
              "name": "alert_threshold",
              "value": 40,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "n_gainers",
              "name": "n_gainers",
              "value": 20,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "fetch_days",
              "name": "fetch_days",
              "value": 88,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "execute-patrol",
      "name": "Run Siskamling Patrol",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        340
      ],
      "notes": "Eksekusi runner patroli bot Python dengan output JSON manifest.",
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=/home/diwan/.hermes/tools/python-3.14.7+20240901-linux-x64/bin/python3 -m siskamling.bot --broadcast --threshold {{ $json.alert_threshold }} --n-gainers {{ $json.n_gainers }} --days {{ $json.fetch_days }} --json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-manifest",
      "name": "Parse Run Manifest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        340
      ],
      "notes": "Parsing hasil eksekusi manifest JSON dan format data ringkasan ronda.",
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.stdout || \"{}\";\ntry {\n  const manifest = JSON.parse(raw);\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      status: manifest.n_alerts > 0 ? \"🚨 Alarm Bahaya Berbunyi\" : \"🛡️ Pasar Kondusif\",\n      run_id: manifest.run_id,\n      scanned: manifest.n_gainers_scanned,\n      alerts_count: manifest.n_alerts,\n      errors_count: manifest.n_errors,\n      alerts: manifest.alerts,\n      started_at: manifest.started_at,\n      finished_at: manifest.finished_at\n    }\n  }];\n} catch (e) {\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      status: \"⚠️ Error Parsing Output\",\n      raw_stdout: raw,\n      error: e.message\n    }\n  }];\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-documentation",
      "name": "Documentation Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏘️ Siskamling Pasar — IDX Radar Anti-Pom-Pom\n**Otomasi Patroli Sore Bursa Efek Indonesia (Track 2: Automation & Workflows)**\n\n### Cara Kerja\n1. **Trigger**: Berjalan otomatis tiap hari bursa pukul 16:30 WIB (atau klik tombol *Test Patrol On-Demand*).\n2. **Configuration**: Ubah parameter threshold skor risiko (default: 40) atau jumlah top gainers (default: 20) langsung dari satu kotak.\n3. **Run Patrol**: Python runner memindai top gainers, evaluasi 4 pilar teknikal deterministik, LLM persona Pak RT, lalu kirim alert ke Telegram.\n4. **Manifest**: Hasil tercatat rapi di run history dan folder .",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
